    usage: 'Platform publishes portal, member and invitation events; Work publishes project, task, field and layout events and consumes the member events. Single node in KRaft mode, auto-create of topics is off.',
    learn: ['Partitions, keys and why order is only per key', 'Consumer groups and offsets (what "earliest" means)', 'acks=all, retries and idempotent producers', 'Add a second consumer group and watch both receive every event'],
